# Vercel upload ignores for the **web project** (Root Directory = apps/web).
#
# Vercel uses the `.vercelignore` found in the project root (here) and only falls
# back to the repository-root file when this one is missing. Having this file is
# what guarantees the root file's `apps/web/` entry (meant for the API project)
# can never blank out the Next.js upload.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.vercel/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
